<s-1 id="RM0000023CE007X_04_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BU700000">
<ptxt>Inspect Shift Lock Control Unit Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Shift Lock Control Computer Inspection</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Before measuring, inspect the power supply (11 to 14V with ignition switch ON) and ground (5 Ω or less between each ground terminal and the engine/body with ignition switch OFF).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>With the connector connected to the computer, inspect from the wire harness side of the connector.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance or voltage between each terminal.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C117246J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
